{"version":1,"content":"<p>國際天文學界近日公佈一項引人關注的新發現。研究人員利用歐洲南方天文台（ESO）位於智利阿塔卡馬沙漠的甚大望遠鏡（VLT），在一顆已經死亡的恆星周圍發現了罕見的雙層行星殘骸環結構。這一系統不僅展現了行星系統毀滅後的複雜景象，也可能為人類提前揭示太陽系未來的演化結局。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1586950.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T11:04:02.758516+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":137,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T10:46:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T10:57:16.180424+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T10:57:16.180424+00:00","content_hash":"4be6c6f0437a7d319fd8213ce4ada24b22d2887ce9ffaf01253164a6cd0452b3","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}